# The hosts the Bots' computers may reach through the egress proxy, one
# extended regular expression per line, matched against the host name.
# Anything not listed is refused. To keep your own list outside the checkout,
# point OPENBOT_SANDBOX_EGRESS_ALLOWLIST in .env at it.
#
# A domain and its subdomains:  (^|\.)example\.com$
# One exact host:               ^api\.example\.com$
(^|\.)wikipedia\.org$
(^|\.)github\.com$
(^|\.)githubusercontent\.com$
